{"id":"629677","name":"猪油白吉馍","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/629677/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"400克"},{"name":"猪油","amount":"20克"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"4克"}],"sub":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪油放入面粉中，手搓均匀。","img":"images/629677/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入酵母粉。","img":"images/629677/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入白糖。","img":"images/629677/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"温水和面，静置发酵。","img":"images/629677/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"面已发酵，有了很多的气孔。","img":"images/629677/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"移至面板，揉匀排气分成等份。","img":"images/629677/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取一份揉匀，擀成圆形。","img":"images/629677/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用叉子扎小孔。","img":"images/629677/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煎烤机预热刷油，将饼胚放入底盘。","img":"images/629677/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"上下火加热，两面金黄即可出锅。","img":"images/629677/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"用来夹肉夹菜。","img":"images/629677/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}